/* 6位常驻NPC关系推进后的具体日常 6 × 4段 = 24段（Sera/Vesper/Noel/Lin/Monet/Ash，零初见、必含独立双检定） */

:: MP RelDay Sera 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
雨夜打烊后，塞拉在钟表铺后间煮了一壶热可可。她摘下放大镜揉着酸痛的鼻梁，桌上还摊着一只没校准完的航海怀表。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-sera-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "替她按揉紧绷的太阳穴 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 230 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	塞拉放松地仰靠在你掌心，轻声说起小时候跟父亲学修表的往事。<span class="green">她在你身边卸下了满身疲惫。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去周日旧货早市 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你手劲稍重碰歪了桌角的铜放大镜，塞拉失笑地握住你的手教你认准力道。<span class="red">你有些局促地收回了手。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去周日旧货早市 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "拿过镊子帮她调准游丝 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-1">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="green">她在你身边卸下了满身疲惫。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去周日旧货早市 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你有些局促地收回了手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去周日旧货早市 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Sera 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
清晨微雾中，你陪塞拉去梅尔街旧货早市淘换蓝钢游丝。摊主看她是熟面孔，故意把一只怀表机芯的价格抬高了一倍。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-sera-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "指出机芯擒纵叉的暗裂 (0:07)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	摊主被你一口点破瑕疵，讪讪地按原价把蓝钢游丝让给了你们，塞拉笑着挽住你的手臂。<span class="green">你帮塞拉省下了一笔冤枉钱。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺应付催租管事 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	摊主一口咬定不降价，塞拉拉了拉你的衣袖示意去别家看看。<span class="red">交涉无果，你们在冷风里多跑了两条街。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺应付催租管事 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "出言替塞拉压低进货价 (0:07)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-2">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="green">你帮塞拉省下了一笔冤枉钱。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺应付催租管事 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">交涉无果，你们在冷风里多跑了两条街。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[回钟表铺应付催租管事 (0:05)|MP RelDay Sera 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Sera 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
午后刚回钟表铺，商会管事便揣着账本上门，借口修缮外墙想提前收取下季度的铺面押金。塞拉蹙起秀眉站在柜台后。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-sera-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "翻出租约指出免责条款 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-3">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	管事见你把市政租约背得分毫不差，灰溜溜地收起账本告辞，塞拉感激地握紧你的手指。<span class="green">你干净利落地替塞拉挡回了刁难。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随她上阁楼听整点钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	管事嘟囔着改日再来核查，屋里气氛一时有些沉闷。<span class="red">争执让你和塞拉都添了几分烦闷。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随她上阁楼听整点钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "挡在柜台前冷脸送客 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-3">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 450 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="green">你干净利落地替塞拉挡回了刁难。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随她上阁楼听整点钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">争执让你和塞拉都添了几分烦闷。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随她上阁楼听整点钟声 (0:04)|MP RelDay Sera 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Sera 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.sera>>
夜深人静，塞拉牵着你坐上阁楼天窗下的绒毯。远处钟塔敲响十一下浑厚钟鸣，她把微凉的脸颊贴在你肩窝里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到塞拉身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-sera-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "揽住她肩膀披上厚绒毯 (0:10)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	塞拉在你怀里安心闭上双眼，将一枚亲手打磨的黄铜平安扣塞进你掌心。<span class="green">你们在钟鸣里度过了静谧的一夜。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">塞拉塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别塞拉返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	夜风从天窗缝隙漏进来，你打了个寒颤，塞拉连忙起身去关紧木窗。<span class="red">夜凉侵体，你们只得早早下楼歇息。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别塞拉返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "与她十指紧扣细数星轨 (0:10)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-sera-4">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="green">你们在钟鸣里度过了静谧的一夜。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_sera_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">塞拉塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别塞拉返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">夜凉侵体，你们只得早早下楼歇息。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[告别塞拉返回 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
大雾弥漫的清晨，维斯在防波堤背风处支起铁锅熬鲜鱼汤。他递给你一把短刀，让你帮忙处理刚钓上来的海鲈鱼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-vesper-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "利落刮鳞片出雪白鱼肉 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-1">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	奶白鱼汤香气四溢，维斯先把最鲜嫩的一碗盛给你，眼神格外柔和。<span class="green">热腾腾的鱼汤驱散了清晨海雾的寒意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去干船坞补桐油灰 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鱼鳍硬刺扎了一下你的指腹，浓烟也呛得你直揉眼睛。<span class="red">你在处理海鱼时不小心扎痛了手。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去干船坞补桐油灰 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "往炭火里添干柴稳住火候 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="green">热腾腾的鱼汤驱散了清晨海雾的寒意。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去干船坞补桐油灰 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">你在处理海鱼时不小心扎痛了手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去干船坞补桐油灰 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 2]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
退潮后的干船坞里，维斯正踩着脚手架给双桅船底舱捻桐油麻丝。木桶里的熟桐油快见底了，船舷高处还有一道缝没封严。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-vesper-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "攀上脚手架帮他压实麻丝 (0:09)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	你们配合默契地在涨潮前封严了整条龙骨接缝，维斯跳下木架替你擦去鼻尖沾的油灰。<span class="green">船底接缝被你们修补得滴水不漏。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[替他在暗巷应付眼线 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	脚手架木板湿滑，你递油桶时洒出半勺桐油沾在靴面上。<span class="red">湿滑木架让你险些扭伤脚踝。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[替他在暗巷应付眼线 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link "在船底熬热桐油递上木勺 (0:09)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	<span class="green">船底接缝被你们修补得滴水不漏。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[替他在暗巷应付眼线 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">湿滑木架让你险些扭伤脚踝。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[替他在暗巷应付眼线 (0:05)|MP RelDay Vesper 3]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
傍晚走出船坞时，一名生面孔的海关眼线在巷口探头探脑，试图打听维斯双桅船今晚的去向。维斯按住腰间短棍朝你使了个眼色。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-vesper-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用港口俚语把眼线支去北岸 (0:07)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-3">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
