	<span class="green">你三言两语替维斯引开了眼线。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随他回船长室烤火夜饮 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">眼线起了疑心，你们不得不绕远路离开。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[随他回船长室烤火夜饮 (0:04)|MP RelDay Vesper 4]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP RelDay Vesper 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
夜航归来后，船长室小铁炉上烤着咸鱼干。维斯把厚重的海军呢大衣裹在你身上，坐在你身旁擦拭那枚旧罗盘。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回到维斯身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="relday-vesper-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "靠在他肩头听海浪拍舷 (0:10)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#relday-vesper-4">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>
	维斯反手握住你的手指，把一枚刻着顺风航向的古银币放进你衣袋。<span class="green">船长室的炉火温暖而令人心安。</span><<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("relday_vesper_4")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">维斯塞给你 £6 零花补贴。</span><</if>><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
